Notes from *Gerhard Richter Painting* (2011 documentary).

* Even [[Gerhard Richter]] has an idea, and then has to react and improvise as the ideas change — doing the work often changes the idea or the output, you have to roll with that... but you do also have to get started to be on that journey
* Exhibiting is effective and he can do so many, partially because of how he plans, builds models and floor plans and has all the work he's produced ready to be included or not in the mockups
* Even GR is still striving to be better...
* GRAY paintings!?
